      "name": "Sticky Note 842c34d5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        304
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step B: Decision (Workflow 2)\nThe Confirm button sends a POST here. The draft must still have status \"draft\", so a second click changes nothing. Approve: the code works out the late penalty (10% of the maximum per late day) and the final score, then saves one row to the class_record table. Reject: only the draft status changes. The AI total is never trusted without the instructor.",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 2128,
        "height": 624
      }
    }
